{"id":"257329a60eacb063","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-link.md","title":"Link","display":"df-link — Link","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-link","aliases":["58-df-link","Link"],"display":"df-link — Link","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-isotopy.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-link"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-link</span><span>Link</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-link — Link"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f8670aa71d18ef9d\" href=\"?note=f8670aa71d18ef9d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-isotopy.md\">../batch16/58-df-isotopy.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:m\\times S^1\\to S^3\">\\(\\ell:m\\times S^1\\to S^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq S^3\">\\(L\\subseteq S^3\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{m\\times S^1}\">\\(\\tau_{m\\times S^1}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^3}\">\\(\\tau_{S^3}\\)</span> are the standard topologies.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Link}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Link}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(2)\">\\(S^1=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(2)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(4)\">\\(S^3=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(4)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^1}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^1,2)\">\\(\\tau_{S^1}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^1,2)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^3}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^3,4)\">\\(\\tau_{S^3}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^3,4)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{m\\times S^1}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(m,\\mathcal P(m),S^1,\\tau_{S^1})\">\\(\\tau_{m\\times S^1}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(m,\\mathcal P(m),S^1,\\tau_{S^1})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\n\\leftrightarrow\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\n(\\ell,m\\times S^1,\\tau_{m\\times S^1},S^3,\\tau_{S^3})\n\\land L=\\ell[m\\times S^1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\n\\leftrightarrow\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\n(\\ell,m\\times S^1,\\tau_{m\\times S^1},S^3,\\tau_{S^3})\n\\land L=\\ell[m\\times S^1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A link is one embedding of a finite disjoint union of circles; disjointness of components follows from injectivity.</li>\n<li>A linking-number predicate is deliberately not defined here: it requires independently typed orientation, Seifert-surface, transversality, and algebraic-intersection data, none of which is supplied by the dependencies.  For the Borromean rings all pairwise linking numbers vanish, while a Milnor triple invariant is nonzero.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rolfsen, Knots and Links</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-isotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"f8670aa71d18ef9d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-isotopy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:m\\times S^1\\to S^3","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq S^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{m\\times S^1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Link}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S^1=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(2)","display":false},{"tex":"S^3=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(4)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^1}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^1,2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^3}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^3,4)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{m\\times S^1}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(m,\\mathcal P(m),S^1,\\tau_{S^1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\n\\leftrightarrow\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\n(\\ell,m\\times S^1,\\tau_{m\\times S^1},S^3,\\tau_{S^3})\n\\land L=\\ell[m\\times S^1].","display":true}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"e56b42300668cf3b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Link}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (link predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-link.md]])"},{"id":"6a08564d6160b86c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)$ (see [[58-df-link]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-791","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-link.md|58-df-link]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["ca7fc3ab38a11801","c4b4a825f2ea608d","f8670aa71d18ef9d"]}